<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>AI Products</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tabler-icons/2.44.0/iconfont/tabler-icons.min.css">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#000000;
    --wordmark:#232323;
    --accent:#4D6BFF;
    --white:#F5F5F5;
    --gray:#9A9A9A;
    --card:#0B0B0B;
    --border:#1E1E1E;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    color:var(--white);
    padding:100px 40px 120px;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center; position:relative;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:500;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    color:var(--accent);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .wordmark{
    font-size:220px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    color:var(--wordmark);
    line-height:1;
    margin-top:20px;
    user-select:none;
  }
  .heading{
    font-size:44px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:-70px;
    letter-spacing:-0.5px;
  }
  .heading .accent-dot{color:var(--accent);}
  .sub{
    max-width:640px;
    margin:24px auto 0;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--gray);
  }

  .cta-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:14px;
    margin-top:32px;
  }
  .btn{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    padding:13px 26px;
    border-radius:6px;
    text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .btn-secondary{
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .included{
    margin-top:70px;
    text-align:left;
  }
  .included .label{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gray);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--border);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top:24px;
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    padding:32px 28px;
  }
  .card i{
    font-size:20px;
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .card h3{
    font-size:16.5px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-top:16px;
  }
  .card p{
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--gray);
    line-height:1.6;
    margin-top:10px;
  }

  .strip{
    margin-top:70px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:30px 0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr);
    text-align:left;
  }
  .strip .sitem{
    padding:0 20px;
    border-left:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .strip .sitem:first-child{border-left:none;}
  .strip .sitem .val{
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .strip .sitem .label{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--gray);
    margin-top:6px;
  }

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .strip{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .strip .sitem{border-left:none; border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;}
    .strip .sitem:first-child{border-top:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Service</div>
    <div class="wordmark">AI</div>
    <h1 class="heading">AI Products<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">LLM-powered features and AI-native products built on data pipelines that hold up in production, not just in a demo.</p>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="https://www.hynastudio.com/data-ai.html" class="btn btn-primary">Start a project <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <a href="https://www.hynastudio.com/data-ai.html" class="btn btn-secondary">View on hynastudio.com</a>
    </div>

    <div class="included">
      <div class="label">What's included</div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-brain"></i>
          <h3>Model selection & fine-tuning</h3>
          <p>We pick the right model for the job, and fine-tune or prompt-engineer it around your actual data and use case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-database"></i>
          <h3>Production data pipelines</h3>
          <p>Ingestion, cleaning, and vector storage built to handle real traffic, not a one-off notebook.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-plug-connected"></i>
          <h3>RAG & tool integration</h3>
          <p>Retrieval-augmented generation and tool-calling wired into your product so answers stay grounded in your data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-shield-check"></i>
          <h3>Guardrails & evaluation</h3>
          <p>Structured evals and safety guardrails so the AI feature behaves predictably at scale.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-gauge"></i>
          <h3>Latency & cost tuning</h3>
          <p>Caching, batching, and model routing tuned so AI features stay fast and affordable as usage grows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <i class="ti ti-chart-histogram"></i>
          <h3>Usage analytics</h3>
          <p>Visibility into how people actually use the AI feature, so you know what to improve next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="strip">
      <div class="sitem">
        <div class="val">LLM</div>
        <div class="label">Model-agnostic</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sitem">
        <div class="val">RAG</div>
        <div class="label">Grounded answers</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sitem">
        <div class="val">Evals</div>
        <div class="label">Built-in testing</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sitem">
        <div class="val">24/7</div>
        <div class="label">Inference monitoring</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>